WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.400
Narrator: Every stadium is built from the same parts.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.100
Narrator: From the outside in: the Last Mile.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.800
Narrator: The security check point, or PSA.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.900
Narrator: The gates and turnstiles, where fans scan in.

5
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.100
Narrator: The concourse - the walkway around the stadium with toilets, food and prayer rooms.

6
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.700
Narrator: The seating bowl, divided into blocks, rows and seats.

7
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.200
Narrator: A vomitory is the tunnel that links the concourse to the seats.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.900
Narrator: Then the field of play.

9
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:43.200
Narrator: Behind the scenes is back-of-house - staff only, including the mixed zone where players meet the media.

10
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.300
Narrator: And hospitality is the VIP and corporate area.

